flowchart TD
    H[Hardware / kernel state] --> A[State acquisition]
    A --> S[Signal Bus]
    S --> P[Prediction + confidence]
    P --> L[Policy]
    L --> C[Controller / safety gate]
    C --> X[Five-action resolver]
    X --> E[sched_ext or conventional fallback]
    E --> O[Observations]
    O --> Q[S1 S2 S3 S4 and Q]
    Q --> C
